member.remarks:
The capsule's local positive Y axis is its center axis. Sine and cosine
remain authoritative through the exact finite-axis bound calculation;
no rounded normalized world axis is fed back into the geometry.

Direction need not be normalized. When it is normalized, returned
parameters are physical distances. The origin is tested inclusively;
the point at  is tested strictly.

Direction need not be normalized. When it is normalized, returned
parameters are physical distances. The origin is tested inclusively;
the point at  is tested strictly.

The exact segment interval maps to [0, totalDistance] with one
final round-half-to-even conversion. Start containment is inclusive;
end containment is strict and is classified before distance rounding.

The exact segment interval maps to [0, totalDistance] with one
final round-half-to-even conversion. Start containment is inclusive;
end containment is strict and is classified before distance rounding.

Boundary candidates are visited in AB, BC, CA, face order. Triangle-face
roots use a -scaled parameter lattice;
exact wide predicates select the witness before one final point rounding.

